## Interface: 30300
## Title: Journal
## Notes: A retail-style journal in one window: every dungeon and raid with its bosses, abilities, loot and quests, every quest of the realm by zone, and every mount, pet and toy with where to get it. Other addons add tabs of their own. Shift-J, /journal, /quests, /mounts, /pets, /toys. Backed by the mod-forever-journal server module.
## Author: buildthehomelab
## Version: 2.2.0
## OptionalDeps: DragonUI
## SavedVariables: JournalDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: JournalCharDB

